TEXT 0 336 Left 2 ;One schematic, three analyses: AC is the active one, Transient and Noise are alternatives,
TEXT 0 360 Left 2 ;kept as comments the way LTspice keeps them. Each gets a result tab above the plot: click
TEXT 0 384 Left 2 ;one to run it; every tab keeps its own traces, zoom and cursors, and + adds another analysis.
TEXT 0 408 Left 2 ;Series RLC low-pass: f0 = 503 Hz, Q = 3.2 (the AC peak, measured with mag() as in LTspice).
